返すほかなかったんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[4850605]},{"nodeId":4850605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2286032915,"text":"ああ──だから、オイラたちを諦めさせようと、あんなこと言ってたのか。","nextNodeIds":[4850606]},{"nodeId":4850606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3819203387,"text":"まあ、そう簡単に騙されたりしないけどな。","nextNodeIds":[4850607]},{"nodeId":4850607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":2747625851,"text":"#{NICKNAME}の言葉のおかげだよ。これこそ「不可能を排除し、最後に残ったものがいかに奇妙であっても、それが真実」ってやつだね。","nextNodeIds":[4850608]},{"nodeId":4850608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1927380739,"text":"とにかく、飛行っていうのはね、7%の技術と3%の勘、残った90%が全て勇気なんだ。","nextNodeIds":[4850609]},{"nodeId":4850609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2741415091,"text":"さっきのアンバーは、勇気が99%だったけどな…","nextNodeIds":[4850610]},{"nodeId":4850610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1292635659,"text":"へへっ、なんかわたしが初めて飛行テストを受けた時みたい…すごく緊張したけど、最後は無事免許を取れた。","nextNodeIds":[4850611]},{"nodeId":4850611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3302034187,"text":"それからのテストは、そういった緊張感が全然なかったから、なんだか物足りなかったんだよね。","nextNodeIds":[4850612]},{"nodeId":4850612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3259846971,"text":"…待った、アンバーって飛行免許を持ってるんだろ？それ以外に何のテストを受けたんだ？","nextNodeIds":[4850613]},{"nodeId":4850613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3217184019,"text":"それは…モンド城内って飛べないエリアとか、着陸禁止エリアとかが多くて…","nextNodeIds":[4850614]},{"nodeId":4850614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1116756955,"text":"せっかく手に入れた飛行免許もすぐ取り上げられちゃってたから、全部で15回くらい受けたかな。","nextNodeIds":[4850615]},{"nodeId":4850615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":195758339,"text":"でも、いつも一発合格だったよ。やっぱり、わたしの本は最高の指南書だね。","nextNodeIds":[4850616]},{"nodeId":4850616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2544879027,"text":"#…{NICKNAME}、時間があったら、ジンにちゃんとした飛行指南をしてもらおう。","nextNodeIds":[4850617,4850618]},{"nodeId":4850617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2017698195,"text":"分かった…","nextNodeIds":[4850619]},{"nodeId":4850619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":213094587,"text":"じゃ、怪鳥をモンドに送るから先に戻ってるね。","nextNodeIds":[4850620]},{"nodeId":4850620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":622235779,"text":"モンドに戻ったら大聖堂に来てね！飛行免許はそこで渡すから。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":4850618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2642272939,"text":"ジン団長も大変だ。","nextNodeIds":[4850619]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[48506,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2006,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FAIL_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["8"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REMOVE_TRIAL_AVATAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","102"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_LOCK_POINT"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1002"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1016,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":48507,"order":11,"stepDescription":"大聖堂に行き、飛行免許を受け取る","stepDescTextMapHash":2553494855,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1008,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ENTER_ROOM","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJ